yle The title menu is now metal lettering. The selected item lights up in gold, and the screen builds in from the logo down Battle announcements are embroidered banners. Bosses, weather, hazards and reinforcements each carry thei","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T02:29:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498226381","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5096100-1844115010499447","game_id":"steam-5096100","kind":"announcement","title":"The Visuals Have Been Rebuilt","summary":"Same game, but the screen looks quite different now. Everything here was measured, not eyeballed.Visuals- Shadows now match the sky. The sun position was measured per background, so units and the siege engine cast their shadows the same way- The castle walls were redrawn. Shading changes with height, and each block's stonework is offset. The walls were also too bright - that has been toned down- Spell rings and sigils are light now. The flat constant-width outlines are gone, replaced by soft glo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T17:17:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010499447","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5096100-1843481262696928","game_id":"steam-5096100","kind":"announcement","title":"AI Link added","summary":"Today's update adds AI Link. Enable it in Settings and the game will talk to an external AI app, on your PC only.Off (default) — nothing is connected; exactly as beforeCommentary — the app hears what happens; you playAI Plays — the AI picks your squad, placement, rewards and battle movesOnly the text of events and options (in the game's language) is sent, and the app replies with a number and a line of dialogue. All traffic stays on 127.0.0.1: nothing leaves your machine, and no personal data is","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T04:30:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262696928","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:24:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5096100":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:47Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:46Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5096100":"2026-10-26T08:20:47Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5096100":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:46Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:46Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:46Z"},"5168480":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:47Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:47Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:20:47Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5096100","app_id":5096100,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:29Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"5814d92fcdd65b2526eac5debbac511ee8d59c6a0b246bdf5d7331e422d8a7d8","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Load your crew onto a rumbling siege engine and smash through physics-driven castle walls! Battles run themselves — you steer the tide with spells, three war horns, and perfectly timed ram strikes. Pick a commander, swear an oath, equip skills: every run builds different. 30 stages, then Endless.","publishers":[{"name":"SMB Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"SMB Games"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1794481200,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"da